>비고</span></p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 1.41pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.41pt; PADDING-LEFT: 1.41pt; WIDTH: 83.7pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.41pt; HEIGHT: 65.78pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 1.98pt double; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 1.41pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.41pt\" valign=\"center\"><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 나눔고딕; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: 나눔고딕; mso-ascii-font-family: 나눔고딕\">금오공과</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 나눔고딕; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: 나눔고딕; mso-ascii-font-family: 나눔고딕\">대학교</span></p></td><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 1.41pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 1.41pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.41pt; PADDING-LEFT: 1.41pt; WIDTH: 285.9pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.41pt; HEIGHT: 65.78pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 1.98pt double; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.28pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.41pt\" valign=\"center\"><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 한양중고딕; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양중고딕; mso-hansi-font-family: 한양중고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">공학계열</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 한양중고딕; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양중고딕; mso-hansi-font-family: 한양중고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">(기계공학과, 기계설계공학과, 지능기계공학과, 기전공학과,</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 한양중고딕; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 한양중고딕; mso-ascii-font-family: 한양중고딕\">기계시스템공학과, 전자공학과, IT융복합공학과, </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 한양중고딕; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 한양중고딕; mso-ascii-font-family: 한양중고딕\">컴퓨터공학과, 소프트웨어공학과)</span></p></td><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 1.41pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.28pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.41pt; PADDING-LEFT: 1.41pt; WIDTH: 43pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.41pt; HEIGHT: 65.78pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 2.55pt double; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.28pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.41pt\" valign=\"center\"><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 한양중고딕; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양중고딕; mso-hansi-font-family: 한양중고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">0명</span></p></td><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 1.41pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.28pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.41pt; PADDING-LEFT: 1.41pt; WIDTH: 39.69pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.41pt; HEIGHT: 65.78pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 2.55pt double; BORDER-RIGHT: medium none; PADDING-TOP: 1.41pt\" valign=\"center\"><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-LEFT: 6pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 6pt\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HY그래픽M; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: HY그래픽M; mso-hansi-font-family: HY그래픽M; text-shadow: auto\" lang=\"EN-US\">2. 지원자격</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HY그래픽M; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: HY그래픽M; mso-hansi-font-family: HY그래픽M; text-shadow: auto\" lang=\"EN-US\">- 협정대학의 석·박사과정 입학에 결격사유가 없는 자</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HY그래픽M; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: HY그래픽M; mso-hansi-font-family: HY그래픽M; text-shadow: auto\" lang=\"EN-US\">- 협정대학의 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HY그래픽M; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: HY그래픽M; mso-ascii-font-family: HY그래픽M; text-shadow: auto\">학사 또는 석사학위를 취득한 자로서 타기관 및 산업체에 재직중이지 않은 자</span></p><p style=\"L